            </div>
            <details class="call-flow">
                <summary>Xem quy trinh cuoc goi</summary>
                <ol>
                    <li>Xac thuc nguoi benh va trieu chung chinh.</li>
                    <li>Mo ho so tom tat, chi so theo doi va don thuoc gan nhat.</li>
                    <li>Ket thuc bang huong dan tai kham va thong bao tren ung dung.</li>
